<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.progress.title")}
        description="Progress 是 RML 的线性进度条组件。通过 value 设置进度值（0–100），loading 切换加载中动画，支持 4 种尺寸。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>基础用法</h3>
                <p>value 属性设置进度百分比，{status_text}</p>
                <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="8px">
                    <Progress value={current} />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>尺寸 size</h3>
                <p>size 属性控制进度条高度：xsmall(4px) / small(6px) / medium(8px) / large(10px)。4 档视觉区分明显。</p>
                <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="12px">
                    <Progress value={current} size="xsmall" />
                    <Progress value={current} size="small" />
                    <Progress value={current} size="medium" />
                    <Progress value={current} size="large" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>加载中状态 loading</h3>
                <p>loading 属性显示无限滑动动画，value 被忽略。支持静态 <code>loading=""</code> 与绑定 <code>loading=\{is_loading\}</code>。</p>
                <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="8px">
                    <Progress loading="" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>交互演示（if 条件渲染）</h3>
                <p>通过命令修改 current 字段，实时反映到 value 绑定；切换 loading 状态用 if 条件渲染不同 Progress。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="减少 10" on-click={on_decrease} />
                    <Button label="增加 10" primary on-click={on_increase} />
                    <Button label="切换 loading" on-click={on_toggle_loading} />
                </div>
                <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="8px">
                    <Progress value={current} if={!loading} />
                    <Progress loading="" if={loading} />
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>

        <template slot="api">
            <h3>Progress</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>另：<code>size</code> 属性为通用尺寸属性。</p>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
